nodes.instructions:
Translate the free-form description in metadata.plan_input into a structured plan. Emit evidence whose metadata.plan_payloads maps each downstream node_key to {instructions, metadata?} so the run executes against concrete specs.

Expected downstream keys: pm_approve, implement, commit_and_push, qa_verify.

Example payload shape:
{
  "pm_approve": {"instructions": "Approve scope: ..."},
  "implement":  {"instructions": "Build it in src/...", "metadata": {"preferred_stack": "FastAPI"}},
  "commit_and_push": {"instructions": "Commit on branch feature/..."},
  "qa_verify": {"instructions": "Verify against ..."}
}
